{"id": "t005-002", "text": "Remind me to ask Santiago how dinner with his in-laws went on Saturday", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Santiago how dinner with his in-laws went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "in-laws", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t005-004", "text": "Call with Teresa — she's coming down on the 3rd of June, arriving about 4pm. Need to book a table somewhere with decent veggie options because her husband Arturo is coeliac and she doesn't eat red meat. She also said Arturo's been a bit low since he retired in the summer, so it'd be nice to make a fuss of him, maybe that tapas place he liked last time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "about 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book a table somewhere with decent veggie options", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat red meat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit low", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retired", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "make a fuss of him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "tapas place", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t005-005", "text": "Alejandro (Ale) turns 40 on 22/11. his wife's planning a surprise thing at the Crown, Sat 23rd at 8. dont say anything", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ale", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 40", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise thing at the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 23rd at 8", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t005-010", "text": "Agnieszka (Aga) loves dark chocolate, the 85% stuff, and anything with cherries. Her name day is 16 December, which is a bigger deal than her birthday in her family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aga", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dark chocolate, the 85% stuff", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "anything with cherries", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "name day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "16 December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t005-011", "text": "So I bumped into Seo-yeon at the station and she was saying her sister is getting married in Seoul on the 9th of October next year, and she's flying out on the 2nd, um, and she's quite stressed about the speech because she's maid of honour. Remind me to message her nearer the time to see how the speech is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Seoul", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th of October next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearer the time", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t005-012", "text": "Antoine and Manon are having people round for Manon's 30th, Sat 8 March from 7ish. Should bring wine - they both drink red, Manon won't touch rosé. Antoine said she's been dropping hints about a cookery course, so that could be a joint present from a few of us. Ask Sam and Olga if they want to chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having people round", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 8 March from 7ish", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring wine", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "drink red", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "won't touch rosé", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a cookery course", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Sam and Olga if they want to chip in", "owner": "p6", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t005-013", "text": "Milan's birthday drinks this Friday are off, he's got covid. Rearranging for sometime after the 20th", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Friday"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covid", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t005-018", "text": "Ann + Juan anniversary 12 Sept - 25 yrs!! kids organising a do. I should get them a card at least", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 Sept", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "25 yrs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t005-020", "text": "Karim's fasting for Ramadan so no lunches for a bit. He suggested iftar at his on the 18th instead, around quarter past 7.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fasting for Ramadan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "iftar at his", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around quarter past 7", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t005-022", "text": "Long catch-up with Caroline on the phone. Her son Liam got into Leeds for medicine and starts in September, she's thrilled but obviously emotional about him leaving home. She's also been struggling with her back, physio twice a week now, and she's trying gluten free to see if it helps with the bloating. Her birthday is the 27th of April, she said a nice candle or some bath stuff, nothing big. Must ring her the week he moves out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Leeds for medicine", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "emotional", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with her back", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "physio twice a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying gluten free", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "bloating", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th of April", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "nice candle or some bath stuff", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week he moves out", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t005-025", "text": "Yusuf coming to stay 2nd-5th Nov. Halal only, and he doesn't eat lamb funnily enough. Pick him up from Euston Friday at 6. He wants to see the Hockney exhibition Saturday morning and he's mad about Turkish breakfasts, so maybe that place on Green Lanes after. Also his birthday is the 4th so get a cake for Sunday night", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd-5th Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Halal only", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat lamb", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick him up from Euston", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 6", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Hockney exhibition", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Turkish breakfasts", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a cake", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t005-031", "text": "Spoke to Chiara this morning, her grandad passed away on Sunday. The funeral is Thursday the 12th at half 9 in Bergamo and she flies out Tuesday night. Send flowers to her flat before she goes. She said her mum isn't coping well at all, and Chiara's the one sorting most of the arrangements. Message her over the weekend to see how she's holding up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send flowers to her flat", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't coping well", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t005-033", "text": "Michael and his partner are expecting! Due early March. They haven't told his parents yet so keep it quiet", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t005-037", "text": "Teresa can't do Sunday lunch anymore, her knee's playing up again. Said we'd try the weekend after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee's playing up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after"}]}
{"id": "t005-044", "text": "Voice note. Pooja's dad has his knee replacement on the 2nd of December, early, like a 7am check in. She's taking the week off to look after him and she sounded pretty tired already. I should drop some food round that weekend, she's vegetarian and doesn't eat egg either.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "7am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat egg", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t005-047", "text": "Caroline's daughter turns 18 next month, she's thinking a meal out rather than a party", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 18", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t005-053", "text": "Anya Nowak, my old flatmate, is visiting from Kraków the weekend of the 22nd. She's coeliac so I need to check which places near us do proper gluten free. She also loves a negroni, and she's never been to the Barbican so maybe Saturday afternoon there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya Nowak", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old flatmate", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend of the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check which places near us do proper gluten free", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "negroni", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "never been to the Barbican", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon"}]}
{"id": "t005-060", "text": "Lunch with Afua and Karim, long one. Afua's sister is moving to Toronto on 1st March for a new job and Afua is gutted about it. Karim's doing his first half marathon on 16 Feb, still having a pint most nights though. We all want a curry night soon, maybe Friday the 7th at 7:30. Afua can't do anything too spicy since her stomach problems. Remind me to sort the booking by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Toronto", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first half marathon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "16 Feb", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "having a pint most nights", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 7th at 7:30", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do anything too spicy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "stomach problems", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the booking", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
